flowchart TD
  Stock[Actual warehouse stock cells] --> Estimate[Pure geometric pick + delivery estimate]
  Estimate --> Select[Try nearest estimated source first / stable IDs]
  Select --> Clear{Actual availability / access / capacity valid?}
  Clear -->|no| Select
  Clear -->|yes| Route[Same current physical geometry]
  Route --> Direct{Straight segment clear?}
  Direct -->|yes| Use[Use first physically feasible warehouse source]
  Direct -->|no| Cache{Exact endpoint query in unchanged geometry?}
  Cache -->|yes| Detached[Detached previously guarded path]
  Cache -->|no| Native[Godot native uniform0.5m jump search]
  Native --> Guard[Exact endpoint and segment clearance]
  Guard -->|valid| Save[Bounded geometry-query reuse / approved smoothing]
  Guard -->|unsupported| Legacy[Existing conservative visibility fallback]
  Detached --> Use
  Save --> Use
  Legacy --> Use
  Use --> Claim[Actual final source/destination/worker reservation]
  Changed[Actual geometry changes] --> Invalidate[Invalidate native mask/query reuse]
  Invalidate --> Route
